A block-sliding puzzle where LEFT/RIGHT/UP/DOWN pan the view and SPACE flips the piece while spending the white-counter budget. Goal: maneuver the yellow piece to the target before the counter runs out. The recorded play is an exploration/reset sequence; the winning state is not shown.

